- `capability extended-nh` negotiates RFC 8950 extended next-hop encoding, allowing VPNv4 routes to use IPv6 next-hop addresses (critical for cross-vendor interoperability).  

Replace `<group_name>` with your BGP peer group name. This configuration ensures proper signaling of IPv6 next-hop capability for VPNv4 NLRIs.
