To enforce strict adherence to tagged BGP next-hop policies for transport tunnel resolution on Nokia 7750 SR routers, configure a resolution filter that selectively uses SR-TE tunnels with specific administrative tags. This ensures tunnel selection is restricted to predefined tags without disrupting existing LSP computations.

```cli
configure router
