- **Resetting the session** forces the peer into the configured idle state during maintenance. Reversing the configuration and resetting again restores the session gracefully.

Replace `<group-name>` and `<neighbor-ip>` with your BGP group and neighbor IP address. Adjust idle/error intervals if a different isolation duration is needed.
